{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay of LootBox rely on three main parts: Character Collection, Item Looting, Dungeon Exploring. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently there are 4 ACTs in this EA stage.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are around 72+ characters with 250+ unique skills in this early access version and each of them have unique role of battling. you can find all of them in Lootboxes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 100+ types of gears including unique items in game which has Diablo style Affixes system. try to min-max them to test the limit of each creatures. There is also an item enhancing system to enhance the power-up experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 70+ unique maps with 30+ bosses to test your team's battle ability.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2919510?t=1769528893","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2919510?t=1769528893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919510/ac758a92cc1dc18aae9305d37c6b8710a6847487/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769528893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919510/ac758a92cc1dc18aae9305d37c6b8710a6847487/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769528893","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":n